  - "Boooooom! \u0130nan\u0131lmazs\u0131n {{isim}}..."
  - "Bu yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n, futbolda orta sahadan gol atmak gibi bir \u015Fey.
    Kusursuzzz!"
  - "Huuuvvv!!! Onca noktay\u0131 tek seferde 90'a takt\u0131n {{isim}}, vallahi
    bravo!"
  - "Vaaayy anas\u0131n\u0131\u0131\u0131! <sprite=13><sprite=13><sprite=13>"
  - "G\xF6zlerime inanam\u0131yorum, o nas\u0131l hareket! <sprite=17> <sprite=13>
